Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Font Awesome Free 6.7.2 — icon path data
    The platform marks (email, LinkedIn, GitHub, website) in templates/lib.typ
    are inlined SVG path data derived from Font Awesome Free 6.7.2.
    Icons: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
    Source: https://fontawesome.com  ·  https://github.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome
    Only the path data is used; no Font Awesome font file, CSS or JavaScript is
    redistributed here.

Typefaces
    No font binaries are distributed with this skill. The font pools in
    scripts/pick_design.py name faces that are either packaged by common Linux
    distributions or available from Google Fonts under the SIL Open Font
    License 1.1. See references/fonts.md for provenance, licences and
    installation. Each face remains under its own licence.
